{
 "duration": 68.779,
 "exact_word_timing": false,
 "lines": [
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "Every time you ask an AI something, your words leave your laptop.",
   "start": 0.15,
   "end": 4.138
  },
  {
   "beat": 0,
   "text": "As of October sixteenth, they don't have to.",
   "start": 4.258,
   "end": 6.725
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "Today, your question flies to a data center,",
   "start": 7.025,
   "end": 9.576
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "waits in line on someone else's computer,",
   "start": 9.696,
   "end": 12.21
  },
  {
   "beat": 1,
   "text": "and the answer flies all the way back.",
   "start": 12.33,
   "end": 14.138
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "That's the lag. That's the subscription.",
   "start": 14.438,
   "end": 16.657
  },
  {
   "beat": 2,
   "text": "And that's your private files, out for a ride.",
   "start": 16.777,
   "end": 19.098
  },
  {
   "beat": 3,
   "text": "NVIDIA's RTX Spark puts a data center chip inside a laptop.",
   "start": 19.398,
   "end": 23.275
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Twenty Grace CPU cores, built with MediaTek.",
   "start": 23.575,
   "end": 26.507
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Six thousand one hundred forty-four Blackwell GPU cores.",
   "start": 26.627,
   "end": 30.285
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "Up to one petaflop of AI math.",
   "start": 30.405,
   "end": 32.824
  },
  {
   "beat": 4,
   "text": "On paper, that's a million billion calculations, every second.",
   "start": 32.944,
   "end": 37.379
  },
  {
   "beat": 5,
   "text": "But the real trick isn't speed. It's memory.",
   "start": 37.679,
   "end": 40.204
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "A gaming laptop splits its memory in two.",
   "start": 40.504,
   "end": 42.982
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "Here, both chips share one pool, up to a hundred and twenty-eight gigabytes.",
   "start": 43.102,
   "end": 47.686
  },
  {
   "beat": 6,
   "text": "NVIDIA says that runs AI models with a hundred and twenty billion parameters, right on your lap.",
   "start": 47.806,
   "end": 53.156
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "The catch? It's an Arm chip.",
   "start": 53.456,
   "end": 55.583
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "Older Windows apps run through a translator called Prism.",
   "start": 55.703,
   "end": 59.078
  },
  {
   "beat": 7,
   "text": "And it starts at two thousand five hundred ninety-nine dollars.",
   "start": 59.198,
   "end": 62.019
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "Six brands are selling them now.",
   "start": 62.319,
   "end": 63.999
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "Your next AI might not live in the cloud.",
   "start": 64.119,
   "end": 66.594
  },
  {
   "beat": 8,
   "text": "It might live right here.",
   "start": 66.714,
   "end": 68.079
  }
 ],
